    // (v140) D. UNDER THE BODY'S LINE BOTH KNEES ONE WAY: toward the toes, turned WallRideKneeTurn (60) toward the deck's LEADING end (the way you
    // travel along the wall) -- the ankle is the line's pivot, the knee pick's flex limits are not asked; further round (to 90) while a knee
    // would come within WR_KNEE_ROOM of the wall. WrKneePick swung each knee to its OWN end (the "M" of 19 Oct's front views)
    const V3 leadDir = (dot(Xd, A) >= 0.0f) ? Xd : mul(Xd, -1.0f);
